              "body": "S: Doing OK. Says he is drinking \"just beer, just weekends\" since February. Brother not here today. Mood better (PHQ-9 4). Working again, ground level. Stools fine; taking enzymes. Gait unchanged, no new falls.\nO: Calm, no tremor. Anicteric. Abdomen soft. Wide-based gait.\nA/P: DTs episode in January, resolved; history kept in the narrative. AUD: less than before by report. Reiterated: if he stops, he calls us first. Still declines a program. LFTs, GGT, CBC. Thiamine/folate/MVI refilled. RTC 3 months."
